### 船舶危险货箱配载审定服务 REST 示例（VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client）
### 变量 @id 在首次创建后手动替换，或用客户端的脚本能力提取。

@host = http://localhost:3000
@id = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 健康检查
GET {{host}}/health

### 登记航次
POST {{host}}/api/voyages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "voyageNo": "V-2026-001",
  "bays": 3,
  "rows": 2,
  "tiers": 3,
  "defaultColumnWeightLimit": "10000",
  "columnWeightLimits": [
    { "bay": 1, "row": 1, "weightLimit": "1200" }
  ],
  "boxes": [
    { "boxNo": "BOX-1", "weight": "500",    "category": "1" },
    { "boxNo": "BOX-2", "weight": "600",    "category": "3" },
    { "boxNo": "BOX-3", "weight": "400",    "category": "5" },
    { "boxNo": "BOX-4", "weight": "300.25", "category": "1" }
  ],
  "incompatRules": [
    { "categoryA": "1", "categoryB": "3", "minDistance": 3 }
  ]
}

### 航次列表
GET {{host}}/api/voyages

### 当前布局
GET {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/layout

### 历史布局（某修订号）
GET {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/layout?rev=1

### 整批调整（携带所见修订号；position=null 表示暂留空；允许同批交换）
POST {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/moves
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baseRevision": 0,
  "moves": [
    { "boxNo": "BOX-1", "position": { "bay": 1, "row": 1, "tier": 0 } },
    { "boxNo": "BOX-2", "position": { "bay": 3, "row": 2, "tier": 0 } },
    { "boxNo": "BOX-3", "position": { "bay": 2, "row": 2, "tier": 0 } },
    { "boxNo": "BOX-4", "position": { "bay": 1, "row": 1, "tier": 1 } }
  ]
}

### 同批交换（同列上下互换）
POST {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/moves
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baseRevision": 1,
  "moves": [
    { "boxNo": "BOX-1", "position": { "bay": 1, "row": 1, "tier": 1 } },
    { "boxNo": "BOX-4", "position": { "bay": 1, "row": 1, "tier": 0 } }
  ]
}

### 撤位（暂留空）
POST {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/moves
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baseRevision": 2,
  "moves": [
    { "boxNo": "BOX-3", "position": null }
  ]
}

### 签发装载清单（所有箱须已配位；冻结当前修订号）
POST {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/manifests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedRevision": 4
}

### 清单列表（旧清单保留，current 标识是否指向当前布局）
GET {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/manifests

### 取某修订号的冻结清单
GET {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/manifests/4

### ==========================================================
### 现场装船核对（基准为已签发清单；先把下面 @rev 设为已签发修订号）
### ==========================================================

@rev = 4
@job = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 以某修订号的“已签发清单”开启核对作业（同清单至多一个，重复开启幂等）
POST {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/verification-jobs/{{rev}}

### 航次的核对作业列表
GET {{host}}/api/voyages/{{id}}/verification-jobs

### 作业详情 + 核对明细（应装/已核对/缺失/错位/清单外）
GET {{host}}/api/verification-jobs/{{job}}

### 上报实装（坐标）与撤销（revoked:true 或 position:null；reportId 唯一）
POST {{host}}/api/verification-jobs/{{job}}/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reports": [
    { "reportId": "R-1", "boxNo": "BOX-1", "position": { "bay": 1, "row": 1, "tier": 0 } },
    { "reportId": "R-2", "boxNo": "BOX-2", "revoked": true }
  ]
}

### 相同上报号+相同内容重试（幂等返回原结果）
POST {{host}}/api/verification-jobs/{{job}}/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reports": [
    { "reportId": "R-1", "boxNo": "BOX-1", "position": { "bay": 1, "row": 1, "tier": 0 } }
  ]
}

### 上报留痕（作业内顺序，撤销/重试均可追溯）
GET {{host}}/api/verification-jobs/{{job}}/reports

### 申请结案：完全一致才冻结；有差异返回 409 且作业继续开放
POST {{host}}/api/verification-jobs/{{job}}/close

